.TH DTPRINTEGRATE 1M "2026-11-22" "Amiga UNIX add-on" "CDE"
.SH NAME
dtprintegrate \- give a printer an icon and actions on the desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dtprintegrate
.RB [ \-d
.IR destination ]
.RB [ \-i
.IR icon ]
.RB [ \-h
.I text
|
.B \-f
.IR helpfile ]
.RB [ \-r ]
.RB [ \-u ]
.RB [ \-v ]
.I printer
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dtprintegrate
makes the desktop configuration for a printer of the LP print service:
the action and data type definitions in
.IR /etc/dt/appconfig/types/C/ printer .dt
and the printer's icon in the Application Manager's Printers folder,
.IR /etc/dt/appconfig/appmanager/C/Printers .
Files dropped on the icon are printed on that printer.
The administrator runs it after adding a printer with
.BR lpadmin (1M).
.TP 16
.BI \-d " destination"
the LP destination the actions print to (default:
.IR printer )
.TP
.BI \-i " icon"
the icon that stands for the printer
.TP
.BI \-h " text"
the printer's help text
.TP
.BI \-f " helpfile"
a file that holds the printer's help text
.TP
.B \-r
reload the desktop's action database afterwards
.TP
.B \-u
remove the printer's desktop configuration
.TP
.B \-v
report what it does on standard output
.SH NOTES
.B dtprintegrate
is a
.B ksh
script.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dtlp (1),
.BR dtprintinfo (1),
.BR lpadmin (1M)
